{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36220","headline":"题陶详校书阳羡隐居 · 方干","name":"题陶详校书阳羡隐居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芸香署里从容步，阳羡山中啸傲情。\n竿底紫鳞输钓伴，花边白犬吠流莺。\n长潭五月含冰气，孤桧中宵学雨声。\n便泛扁舟应未得，鸱夷弃相始垂名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}